<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>山路 on 凉都小道</title><link>https://ronggle.com/tags/%E5%B1%B1%E8%B7%AF/</link><description>Recent content in 山路 on 凉都小道</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-CN</language><copyright>Soi</copyright><lastBuildDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://ronggle.com/tags/%E5%B1%B1%E8%B7%AF/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>山路的折返</title><link>https://ronggle.com/gallery/tremola-switchbacks/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://ronggle.com/gallery/tremola-switchbacks/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;从高处看，公路不再是两点之间的连线，而是一连串缓慢、耐心、必须亲自经过的折返。&lt;/p&gt;&#10;&lt;p&gt;它像 Wayline 里那条不断向前的路径：方向并不总是一条直线，但只要始终朝着山谷之外，绕远也有意义。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>